    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Rinshi!! Ekoda-chan",
        "jpn": "臨死!! 江古田ちゃん"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Ekoda-chan is from the countryside, living alone in the city. She's a temp worker and a strong, carefree soul, with no solid plan for the future, who doesn't care much about guys. She talks about how she lives her life and provides support to all those women trying to survive in the real life society.",
        "jpn": "地方出身、都市単身生活、非正規労働者、\r\n将来の展望なんかどこ吹く風と気持ちフリーに\r\nオトコ気にせず強く生きている江古田ちゃん。\r\n彼女の生き方語り、リアル社会の全女性への応援歌"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Rinshi!! Ekodachan"
    ],
